WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.760
He forfeits!

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:05.100
It's Toudou Shion's fifth consecutive win of the student championships!

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.060
I'm finished.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.070
What?

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:13.640
No one coming in the next 10 years could challenge me in go.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.770
So I will retire and conquer another field.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:18.030
Eh!?

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.790
They're definitely the next Divine Idols!

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:23.850
For sure!

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.960
<i>Divine Idols?</i>

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.700
Idol... This might be worth a try.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.260
Speed is the essence of war!

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.750
I'll start by defeating those three!

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.930
Toudou Shion will go to war!

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.480
Alright, SoLaMi SMILE.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:22.370
I'm sure you know why I've called you here today. Ahem.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.720
What is it? The important thing?

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.410
Spit it out already-pri.

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.290
You're doing great-kuma!

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:33.370
We know that-pri! Get to it-pri!

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.760
I'm formally announcing our new goal-kuma!

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.600
Our new goal?

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:41.270
Basically, you've proven you're good enough

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:46.180
to be allowed entry to events where the prize is the ultimate coord-kuma!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.520
The ultimate coord?

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:49.980
Yes, and that is...

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:51.820
The Paradise Coord!

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:54.690
The greatest coord to exist in all PriPara-kuma!

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.630
Paradise Coord-pri?

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:57.360
Uh-huh!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.150
Yes-kuma.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:01.720
The events to gain Paradise Prizes, parts of the coord,

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:04.500
are coming around soon.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:10.200
First, you must win the Christmas Idol Grand Prix to gain the Paradise Shoes-kuma!

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.340
Paradise Shoes!

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.970
Yeah, let's do our best!

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:14.630
Pri!

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:20.390
Should SoLaMi SMILE gather every part of the ultimate coord,

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:22.890
I'll be a big shot manager!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:26.790
No, I'll be known as a legend among managers-kuma!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:31.600
Hibernation in the 7LDK caves of my dreams-kuma!

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.850
We'll definitely get those Paradise Shoes together!

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:36.520
Yeah!

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:39.420
We'll be the cutest-pri!

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.760
Amazing!

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:46.830
Combing the premises!

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.040
Move 97? No!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.290
Move 98? No!

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.590
Move 99...

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.130
Found it!

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:03.950
No! This isn't my PriTicket, it's a warning ticket.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:07.350
Yes, from that Disciplinarian, Minami or whatever!

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:16.430
Article #11 of the Paprika Academy Rules: Solving go puzzles in the hallway is forbidden.

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:21.370
Duly noted and ignored. My life is dedicated to learning.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.160
W-What are you doing?

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.680
Be more careful in the future.

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:30.120
You've done it again, Head Disciplinarian!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.790
Not even the student champion's hallway go goes unpunished!

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:38.340
Minami... I swear I will return this humiliation a hundredfold.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.760
One of these days, I'll beat you!

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:44.490
I will have you admit defeat!

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:48.220
Just <i>remembering</i> that is making my blood boil!

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.830
Still, I certainly remember a PriTicket arriving years ago...

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:52.680
But where could it be?

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.730
Move 100? This is it!

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:13.500
Found you.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.600
PriTicket: found!

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.050
With this I can enter PriPara!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.720
A golden opportunity! My chance!

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.180
Let's <i>go!</i>

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:33.100
That said, I'm not sure how to begin this endeavor.

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:35.720
To become an idol...

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:41.270
Is she an idol as well? All right.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.530
Excuse me.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:45.740
Yes?

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.980
Please explain to me how to get started with PriPara.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.200
Capisce!

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:52.200
Oh, I'm Lala.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.370
I-I'm Shion.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.910
I see. That is the meaning of "snapping".

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:00.630
Yeah!

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.600
Prism Stone.

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.760
First we'll have Miss Meganee set you up with a coord.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:09.710
Coord? What kind of move is that?

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.020
I'm in your care.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.470
Don't worry.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:17.060
Alright! I think something cool would fit Shion!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.190
Cool?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:18.950
Yeah!

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:20.660
I... I see.

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.900
Okay, please look over here.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.900
You're quite interesting on the inside.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.500
Y-You see inside me?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:30.110
I see everything.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:33.330
Unpredictable, there is a monster hiding in you.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:34.810
Got it.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:38.410
The Punk Style brand, Baby Monster is right for you!

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.840
Punk?

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:40.590
Punk.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:44.950
A purple color scheme and an edgy feel that breaks expectations.

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:48.840
That's right, you're definitely going beyond the go board.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:52.390
Top, there, bottom, there, shoes, there.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:55.470
Your PriPara coord data is all registered!

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:58.620
Y-Yes, I appreciate it.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.060
Just what kind of clothes are they?

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.270
Next you scan the My Ticket!

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.380
Then you'll get in the PriPara world.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.490
Your outfit will change to the one that was chosen too.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.140
I see.

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:11.700
Lala! Nice timing.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.200
Hm? Toudou Shion?

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.870
Head Disciplinarian Minami, with SoLaMi SMILE's Sophie?

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:20.430
You're friends?

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.380
She's a seventh grader at our school.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:25.190
The world champion in student level go.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.000
Champion? That's amazing!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:27.800
She's...

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.390
She's something of an eccentric though.
Lala.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:29.800
Minami's first name is... Mireille.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.450
Oh, really?

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:32.680
So, how'd you end up with her anyway?
Minami's first name is... Mireille.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:33.760
And there's Sophie.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.170
SoLaMi SMILE...

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.350
<i>Which means...</i>

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.610
<i>That's how it is!</i>

00:07:55.770 --> 00:08:00.250
It was... I see now. This is the power of PriPara.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.360
More importantly...

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.520
Shion, you look great!

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:07.780
This is punk. This is a coord...

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.160
I see. Not bad.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.850
Okay, let's get snapping!

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:17.560
I refuse.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.270
I refuse! White and black can never mix!

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.220
Eh? Just flip them and the color changes!

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:25.850
That isn't go!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:26.520
It's not?

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.570
You're my enemies!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:32.760
I shall defeat SoLaMi SMILE and stand on top of the idol world.

00:08:33.140 --> 00:08:34.450
We must not mingle!

00:08:35.090 --> 00:08:39.910
Just like go pieces, the world is split into white and black, winners and losers!

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:41.370
So pri-sumptuous!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.830
And we have a score to settle.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.500
Pri? What's this about a score?

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.880
