00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.880
That looks great.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.580
Shion?

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.550
So what was that about?

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.480
No idea.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:58.780
Try this egg roll.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:00.240
It's tasty-chanko!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:01.220
Shion...

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:04.940
She's going up against SoLaMi SMILE-usa?

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:07.900
She could be of use-usa.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.480
Well then, to get to the top of the idol world...

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:15.740
Where to start?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.880
Lost in the darkness.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:18.320
Shion!

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.070
Down here, down, down-usa!

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:23.990
Down?

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:28.650
Seems you and I might get along famously-usa.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.170
Usa...

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:36.760
No interest in hearing filthy old me out-usa?

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:40.220
I like white and black, but hate gray.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.380
Survival of the fittest.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:46.020
Nice ring to it, right-usa?

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:49.940
Survival of the fittest. The strong will eat the weak.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:52.240
Sturm und Drang.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:55.150
To struggle through a torrent of strife,

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.750
to be peerless.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.080
To beat down SoLaMi SMILE and every other team!

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:02.320
You alone will be left standing-usa.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.680
I like you.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:08.620
Decisive action: I accept your offer.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:10.040
Deal-usa.

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:13.550
Now, let's go meet your teammates-usa.

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:16.170
Teammates?

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:20.550
Cha-ching!

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:25.460
Shion, these are the two who will team up with you: Dorothy and Leona.

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:26.760
Pleased to meet ya.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:28.480
P-Pleased to meet you.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.480
Pleased to meet you.

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:45.120
Shion, was it?

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:48.330
I'm just as annoyed with SoLaMi SMILE as you are.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:56.050
Leona was just about to rank up and join me in the Potential Idol class!

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:59.070
