00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:01.760
But make sure you don't get in my way.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.760
You blowhard! Right back at you!

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:05.640
What?

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.920
Can you keep up, newbie?

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.600
You're not even that attractive.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.100
Attractive?

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:13.180
Tension max!

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:14.530
Deluxe.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:15.870
Dorothy and

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:16.970
Leona.

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:18.320
Nice to meetcha!

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:22.280
Leona certainly is attractive, but I can't say the same of you.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.790
Huh?

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:24.660
Game over.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.260
Just a second!

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.200
What do <i>you</i> know about attractiveness, anyway?

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:33.960
