00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.420
Yeah, I don't get it! Why don't you show me?

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.550
Oh, come on you two!

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.730
Uh, uh, come on, we're all on the same team here,

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:43.680
If you keep at it, my career...

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.970
My perfect comeback...

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:49.810
so let's try to get along, okay? Okay?

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.200
Fine by me.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.190
But let's see what you can do.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.570
That's terrible-usa.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.120
It's too terrible-usa!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.000
My intuition has finally failed!

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.200
This is pointless.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.460
No way can we beat SoLaMi SMILE with that!

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.420
Let's go, Leona.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:33.350
I see it! Singing is just like go!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:38.070
Just read ahead! As long as you're several steps ahead, you'll win!

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.700
Dance can also be understood through go.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:06.890
7-6, 7-8, 8-5, 6-4,

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:10.240
9-5, 8-3, 8-8, 7-5, 7-4

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:12.930
5-5, 5-4, 6-5, 5-3, 6-1...

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.110
Usa...

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:25.070
She's good! We might be able to beat SoLaMi SMILE with this.

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:29.070
