00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.020
Just lovely!

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:32.540
My intuition <i>was</i> right!

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:34.500
Do you think we can do it?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.460
I'll give it a shot.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.660
That's great.

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.710
Okay, got that worked out.

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.500
Hello, ladies.

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:44.820
