00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.670
Please take a look at your PriPasses.

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:55.620
PriPass?

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:56.390
This-usa!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:58.600
What's this?

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.900
Seeing your hard work has been so very charming.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.320
