00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.030
He's always so cool.

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:32.590
Yeah, yeah!

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:35.230
Ba... Baby?

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:39.440
And now we must decide on a team name-usa.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.440
Team name?

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.770
