00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:00.110
Dorothies!

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:00.860
Perfect!

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.260
Dorodorodorothies!

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:02.920
Perfect!

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:12.210
Dorothy... You two mix like oil and water...

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:14.510
