00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:29.770
Shing? Like sing?

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:33.520
Dressing!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:34.820
It's paféct!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:42.080
Dressing Pafé...

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:44.420
That's good!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:45.780
Sounds like a decision!

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.380
And next, the Making Drama.

