00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.320
Denied.

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:11.950
The important thing is I get the spotlight.

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:15.110
That's a bad shape. Bad idea, in other words.

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:16.720
What?

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:18.020
There, there...

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.750
