00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:24.250
<i>The Punk Style brand, Baby Monster is right for you!</i>

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:27.090
What is "punk" anyway?

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:29.340
You're really out of the loop.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:29.370
Punk is a rock genre that...

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:30.550
There, there...

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.020
Rock?

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:37.440
That went really well!

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.480
I broke a good sweat-pri.

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:40.580
Pshu...

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.310
That was a nice show once again-kuma!

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:45.210
No one can challenge you-kuma!

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:48.260
We're going straight to the top-kuma!

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:53.310
Oh, Shion!

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:54.700
With Dorothy and Leona-pri.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.700
A new team-kuma?

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.410
A declaration of war!

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:04.680
We're going to surpass you.

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:08.690
You'll regret ever dumping us!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:09.540
Pri?

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.010
Stop yawning!

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:15.040
You're lucky we're not in the same event today.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:18.030
You'll just have to lose to us some other day.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:19.510
Pardon us...

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.430
Go has one round. So does song.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:26.100
Both are an all out game with only victory and defeat!

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:29.980
W-We'll take our leave.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:37.050
Shion and Dorothy are both so cocky! Looking down on us like pri-pri!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:40.410
It's okay, you can't get taller that fast.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:44.240
Not like that-pri! Pri-pri-pri...

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.160
What kind of show will it be?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:50.170
Dressing Pafé's team debut. Good luck out there.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.080
P-Pri...

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.560
So powerful!

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.160
They've got some endurance.

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:13.020
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:38.280
Stereo Full Blast Two-Three Rock!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:42.370
Cyalume Change!

00:19:47.760 --> 00:19:48.420
Let's go!

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.870
Isn't Shion the student level go champion?

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:18.890
And she's great as an idol too!

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:21.950
You're so charming, Dorothy!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.530
Leona, you're so cute!

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:28.560
Ku-Kuma... This team... What is this-kuma?

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.350
I don't know about their balance,

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:33.710
but somehow they're making it work at a really high level-kuma.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.410
Usagi!

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:38.170
Is this your team?

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:42.140
This is where my comeback starts-usa.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:44.010
The Usagi Counter-attack!

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:48.660
Dressing Pafé will raise its rank in a flash,

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:51.180
and crush SoLaMi SMILE-usa!

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:57.660
Dressing Pafé is amazing!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:58.720
Cool.

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:01.360
They can walk the walk-pri.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:04.570
No one to challenge us...

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:08.990
We'll get Paradise Coord easy-peasy...

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:13.410
I'll be known as a legendary manager...

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:17.500
Poor old me was riding for a fall.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:21.760
Such a strong opponent appearing...

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:24.240
This is no time for hibernating!

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:28.220
I have to train SoLaMi SMILE harder and harder-kuma!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.390
Striking first impression!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.680
We're Dressing Pafé!

00:21:32.480 --> 00:21:34.890
Pleased to meet you!

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:07.360
Declaration of victory!

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:11.090
Dressing Pafé will take the next event!

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:14.490
My calculations say SoLaMi SMILE will win by a landslide!

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:19.270
I've read the game a hundred turns ahead with my go championship experience.

00:23:19.270 --> 00:23:21.300
The numbers don't lie-pri.

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:22.880
We're 100% winning-pri.

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.340
Will the game plan prevail, or the calculations?

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:26.580
Bring it on!

00:23:26.580 --> 00:23:28.120
It's a fight-pri!

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:32.260
Going Critical? Shion VS Mireille-pri!

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:34.930
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
